  encounterPool:
  - EventTemplateId: point_02_pet_encounter_toyterrier
    EventType: 1
    DisplayName: Milo
    BodyText: Friendly greetings are easier when the leash stays loose and both pets
      have room to look away.
    RewardItemId: 
    EncounterDogName: Milo
    VisitorSpecies: 0
    VisitorPetDefinitionKey: dog_toyterrier
    VisitorDisplayName: Milo
    StopType: 2
    Weight: 1
    OneShotPerSession: 1
  - EventTemplateId: point_02_pet_encounter_beagle
    EventType: 1
    DisplayName: Biscuit
    BodyText: Some streets are busiest near corners. A calm pace helps your pet notice
      bikes, doors, and other walkers.
    RewardItemId: 
    EncounterDogName: Biscuit
    VisitorSpecies: 0
    VisitorPetDefinitionKey: dog_beagle
    VisitorDisplayName: Biscuit
    StopType: 2
    Weight: 1
    OneShotPerSession: 1
  - EventTemplateId: point_02_pet_encounter_cat_simple
    EventType: 1
    DisplayName: Luna
    BodyText: City walks are full of new smells. Let your pet pause sometimes so
      every route feels familiar.
    RewardItemId: 
    EncounterDogName: Luna
    VisitorSpecies: 1
    VisitorPetDefinitionKey: cat_simple
    VisitorDisplayName: Luna
    StopType: 2
    Weight: 1
    OneShotPerSession: 1
  - EventTemplateId: point_02_pet_encounter_cat_chubby
    EventType: 1
    DisplayName: Mochi
    BodyText: Short, happy encounters can build confidence without making the walk
      feel too crowded.
    RewardItemId: 
    EncounterDogName: Mochi
    VisitorSpecies: 1
    VisitorPetDefinitionKey: cat_chubby
    VisitorDisplayName: Mochi
    StopType: 2
    Weight: 1
